---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { skills, links } from '../config';
---
<Base title="About" description="Mechanical engineering student who builds robot hardware and the machine learning around it.">
  <div class="wrap pt-14">
    <p class="mono">About</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Hardware first, then the software around it</h1>

    <div class="prose-site mt-8">
      <p>I moved from India to the US when I was 15. I taught myself to code, mostly by building things until they worked, and that led to three AI and ML internships before I started college.</p>
      <p>Now I'm studying mechanical engineering at Kennesaw State, because I wanted to work on the hardware side of robots too. My research covers a soft surgical robot, a fish robot, thermal imaging and drone sensing. Medical robotics is the subfield I'm leaning toward for now.</p>
      <p>I'm looking for summer 2027 research in medical robotics, or anywhere hardware and learning meet. The quickest way to reach me is <a href={`mailto:${links.email}`}>{links.email}</a>, or my school address, <a href={`mailto:${links.emailSchool}`}>{links.emailSchool}</a>.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-14">Skills</h2>
    <div class="mt-5 grid gap-4">
      {skills.map((g) => (
        <section class="card" aria-label={g.group}>
          <h3 class="mono">{g.group}</h3>
          <ul class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">{g.items.map((i) => <li class="tag">{i}</li>)}</ul>
        </section>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
